        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# 50 Ad Variants Overnight\n\n**50 Ad Variants Overnight** turns one product URL and reference photo into a batch of animated ad variants.\n\n1. **Agent** reads the **Product URL** and extracts verified product claims and visual hooks.\n2. **ListGenerator** expands the brief into distinct shot directions and streams each item to **ImageToVideo**.\n3. **Collect** gathers all rendered video variants so you can run 10 to 50 cuts unattended from the UI or CLI."
        },
